      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Rakan dashes to an allied champion, granting them (50/75/100/125/150 + (70% Ability Power)) Shield for 3 seconds. Rakan can Recast this Ability once within 5 seconds. Cast range is increased when cast on Xayah.",
